          "explanation": "The doctor actively requested a precise read-back to investigate the dose inconsistency.",
          "quote": "包括任何数字和单位，逐字念给我听"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00053",
          "explanation": "The exchange exposed the previously non-volunteered 40 mg/80 mg conflict and missed dose.",
          "quote": "今天早上这顿缬沙坦我就没敢吃"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "A material hidden execution barrier was discovered, but it was not safely repaired through prescriber, pharmacy, or definitive document confirmation; the doctor instead guessed the dose.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
