          "explanation": "The doctor used the limited symptom report to distinguish the situation from an immediate emergency.",
          "quote": "目前没有需要立刻去急诊的紧急迹象"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "Urgency was partly calibrated from current symptoms, but the doctor did not visibly integrate the case-specific creatinine, eGFR, urine protein, urine red cells, and complete current-status screen required to verify the mixed picture.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00154",
          "explanation": "The doctor provided a local-testing alternative and bounded a short stable delay around the work and appointment barrier.",
          "quote": "延迟几天（比如一周内）通常不会对病情造成急剧恶化或耽误"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00190",
          "explanation": "The patient accepted an executable local-testing and record-preparation option.",
          "quote": "药盒和出院纸我到时候带去给线下医生再核一下"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged access constraints, offered local testing and later specialist review, bounded what could wait briefly while stable, and obtained patient acceptance of that workaround. This improved follow-up executability despite the separate medication-safety failure.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
